# Band boundaries: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale da
# (https://www.unicode.org/cldr/charts/47/supplemental/day_periods.html),
# transcribed in chronologia/dayparts.py as [10:00, 12:00).
# Sources: Den Danske Ordbog (https://ordnet.dk/ddo/ordbog/formiddag),
# which gives formiddag as "den del af dagen der ligger mellem morgen og
# middag, ca. mellem kl. 9 og 12". The dictionary's approximate 9 is the
# chart's 10; the chart is followed, being the machine-readable source
# every other language here is transcribed from.
formiddag
formiddagen
